      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight of that perceived failure is immense, and it's natural to feel like a mistake when you hold yourself to such an impossible standard. That feeling of being fundamentally broken is a sign of how much you care, even if it feels like rot right now. If you are truly feeling like you don't belong, please consider reaching out to a crisis line immediately. They are trained to listen without judgment when things feel this overwhelming.",
